From: Vendomat Fork <vendomat-fork@users.noreply.invalid>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] vendomat: add the vendomatFromYAML primop

`vendomatFromYAML name text` parses a strict YAML subset into Nix
attribute sets, lists, and strings. Every scalar stays a string, so
`3.10`, `no`, and `012` keep their text. The parser rejects tabs,
anchors, aliases, tags, flow style, block scalars, document markers,
duplicate keys, unknown escapes, and lists of maps. A syntax error
reads `NAME:LINE:COL: reason`.

The primop is a pure function of its two arguments. A caller reads the
file with `builtins.readFile`, so the evaluation cache tracks the file
and no hidden input exists. The cache key fragment carries a parser
version number. The primop needs no wrapper and no unsafe Nix setting.

The module `yaml_subset.rs` holds 27 unit tests, one for each case
file of the Vendomat front door spike (P2G).

Upstream: fork-only. The strict subset is Vendomat specific.
